OL,3,GNEWSATeacher who threatened to 'do in' 
OL,4,Awoman banned                           
OL,6,FA teacher who told a woman "I will do  
OL,7,Fyou in" and was convicted of two counts
OL,8,Fof assault has been banned from the    
OL,9,Fprofession following a professional    
OL,10,Fconduct hearing.                       
OL,12,FScott Towers, who had worked at New    
OL,13,FCollege Leicester since 2016, now The  
OL,14,FHerewoode Academy, was suspended from  
OL,15,Fthe school with immediate effect after 
OL,16,Fhe informed them of his arrest in July 
OL,17,F2024.                                  
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
