OL,3,GNEWSATeacher who threatened to 'do in' 
OL,4,Awoman banned                           
OL,6,FTowers was convicted of one count of   
OL,7,Fcommon assault and one count of assault
OL,8,Foccasioning actual bodily harm at      
OL,9,FLeicester Magistrates' Court on 14     
OL,10,FMarch 2025.                            
OL,12,FHe was sentenced to an unpaid work     
OL,13,Frequirement of 225 hours to be         
OL,14,Fcompleted within 12 months and to      
OL,15,Fcomply with a rehabilitation activity  
OL,16,Frequirement.                           
